[{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0793","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0793.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21335","title":"Microsoft Windows Hyper-V NT Kernel Integration VSP 权限提升漏洞","description":"Windows Hyper-V NT Kernel Integration 虚拟服务提供程序（VSP）驱动（vkrnlintvsp.sys）存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free，CWE-416）漏洞。该驱动在处理 VMBus 通信时未能正确管理对象内存生命周期，释放对象后仍保留悬垂指针，后续代码路径访问已释放内存时可被利用。已获得 Hyper-V 主机本地低权限的攻击者可通过触发特定操作导致内核内存损坏，实现权限提升至 SYSTEM。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高，已被检测到在野利用，CISA 已将其列入已知被利用漏洞目录。Microsoft 已于 2025 年 1 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21335"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:58Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:07Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新 (KB5050021)，可通过 Windows Update 自动获取或从 Microsoft 更新目录手动下载。该更新修复了 Hyper-V NT Kernel Integration VSP 中的 Use-After-Free 漏洞。如无法立即打补丁，建议限制本地用户对 Hyper-V 组件的访问权限，并遵循最小权限原则管理虚拟机操作。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21335","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2025-21335","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2025/CVE-2025-21335.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/be4eb5d180ce03ee7726c0a777ec4071d20eced1/2025/CVE-2025-21335.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a31aa101497b2d23391e84ef31f75e6600381dae/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21335.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/bbff37eeafd64310b94d439a5f7493406fcdc115/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21335.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21335.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21335.json","https://github.com/splintersfury/KernelSight/blob/c4101ef9174b083b99cf79d99e0c61308bb26f06/docs/case-studies/CVE-2025-21335.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21335.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21335.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/9af727c40ac027294e4558abbc02d8967ee2a1d7/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-213xx/CVE-2025-21335.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0793.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0792","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0792.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21334","title":"Microsoft Windows Hyper-V NT Kernel Integration VSP 权限提升漏洞","description":"Windows Hyper-V NT Kernel Integration 虚拟服务提供程序（VSP）存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞。具有低权限的本地攻击者可利用该漏洞触发已释放内存的访问，导致权限提升至 SYSTEM 级别，从而完全控制受影响系统。该漏洞影响启用了 Hyper-V 角色的 Windows 10/11 及 Windows Server 2022/2025 等版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21334"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:58Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:07Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新 (KB5050021)，可通过 Windows Update 自动获取或从 Microsoft Update Catalog 手动下载。此漏洞为 Hyper-V NT Kernel Integration VSP 中的 Use-After-Free 漏洞，攻击者需拥有本地访问权限，建议同时限制 Hyper-V 主机上的非授权用户登录以降低风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21334","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2025-21334","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2025/CVE-2025-21334.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/be4eb5d180ce03ee7726c0a777ec4071d20eced1/2025/CVE-2025-21334.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a31aa101497b2d23391e84ef31f75e6600381dae/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21334.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/bbff37eeafd64310b94d439a5f7493406fcdc115/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21334.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21334.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21334.json","https://github.com/splintersfury/KernelSight/blob/c4101ef9174b083b99cf79d99e0c61308bb26f06/docs/case-studies/CVE-2025-21334.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21334.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21334.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-213xx/CVE-2025-21334.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0792.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0791","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0791.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21332","title":"Microsoft Windows MapUrlToZone 安全功能绕过漏洞","description":"Windows MapUrlToZone 安全功能存在路径等价解析不当漏洞（CWE-41）。该功能用于将 URL 映射到 Internet、本地 Intranet 等安全区域，由于对 URL 路径等价性的解析逻辑存在缺陷，攻击者可构造特制的 URL 绕过区域映射机制，使恶意网站被错误归类到低限制安全区域，从而绕过安全策略。该漏洞影响 Windows 10/11 及 Windows Server 2008 至 2025 等多个版本。攻击者可通过诱导用户点击恶意链接远程触发，无需认证但需要用户交互，成功利用可导致低度信息泄露。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21332"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:58Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:07Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新 KB5050061，可通过 Windows Update 自动获取或从 Microsoft 更新目录手动下载。该更新修复了 Windows 中 MapUrlToZone 组件的 URL 区域映射绕过漏洞，受影响版本包括 Windows 10/11 及 Windows Server 2008 至 2025。如无法立即打补丁，可配置 Internet 安全区域为高等级并限制从不受信任来源打开链接作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21332","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a31aa101497b2d23391e84ef31f75e6600381dae/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21332.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/bbff37eeafd64310b94d439a5f7493406fcdc115/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21332.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21332.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21332.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21332.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21332.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/abb3d9c240bc75ee9d5885882897d780d10d15cb/2025/CVE-2025-21332.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21332","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21332.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2025-21332"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0791.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0790","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0790.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21331","title":"Microsoft Windows Installer 特权提升漏洞","description":"Windows Installer 存在特权提升漏洞，该漏洞源于安装程序在处理安装操作时未正确验证符号链接路径，导致可被利用进行链接跟随攻击。本地低权限攻击者可通过诱导高权限用户运行特制的恶意安装程序，利用符号链接重定向文件操作，从而以 SYSTEM 权限读取、写入或删除受保护的系统文件，实现权限提升。该漏洞影响所有受支持的 Windows 10/11 及 Windows Server 版本，CVSS 评分 7.3，危害等级高危。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新（KB5050061）中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21331"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:58Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:07Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新（对应 KB5050061），通过 Windows Update 自动获取或从 Microsoft 更新目录手动下载。受影响版本包括 Windows 10/11 及 Windows Server 各版本，升级后系统版本号应达到：Win10 1507≥10.0.10240.20890、Win10 1809≥10.0.17763.6775、Win11 22H2≥10.0.22621.4751、Win Server 2022≥10.0.20348.3091 等。如无法立即打补丁，可限制非管理员用户对 Windows Installer 的调用权限，并启用 AppLocker 或 WDAC 策略阻止未签名 MSI 文件的执行作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21331","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a31aa101497b2d23391e84ef31f75e6600381dae/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21331.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/bbff37eeafd64310b94d439a5f7493406fcdc115/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21331.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21331.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21331.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/c949b5afda95fd3ee92c221c6623ec029ede4a68/2025/CVE-2025-21331/README.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21331.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/c949b5afda95fd3ee92c221c6623ec029ede4a68/2025/CVE-2025-21331/poc.py","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21331.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/abb3d9c240bc75ee9d5885882897d780d10d15cb/2025/CVE-2025-21331.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21331"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0790.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0789","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0789.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21330","title":"Microsoft Windows 远程桌面服务拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Windows 远程桌面服务存在资源消耗漏洞，该漏洞源于系统对特制网络请求的处理不当。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标系统的远程桌面服务发送精心构造的数据包，触发无限循环或资源耗尽，导致目标服务停止响应，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响多个 Windows 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。攻击复杂度低，无需用户交互，仅需网络访问即可利用。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21330"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:57Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:07Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新 KB5050021，可通过 Windows Update 自动获取或从 Microsoft 更新目录手动下载。受影响版本包括 Windows 10/11 及 Windows Server 2019/2022/2025，更新后各版本对应最低内部版本号分别为：Win10 1809≥10.0.17763.6775、Win10 21H2≥10.0.19044.5371、Win10 22H2≥10.0.19045.5371、Win11 22H2≥10.0.22621.4751、Win11 23H2≥10.0.22631.4751、Win11 24H2≥10.0.26100.2894、Server 2022≥10.0.20348.3091。如无法立即打补丁，可在防火墙层面限制对 RDP 端口（TCP 3389）的访问，仅允许受信任 IP 连接，并启用网络级身份验证（NLA）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21330","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a31aa101497b2d23391e84ef31f75e6600381dae/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21330.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/bbff37eeafd64310b94d439a5f7493406fcdc115/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21330.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21330.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21330.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21330.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/c949b5afda95fd3ee92c221c6623ec029ede4a68/2025/CVE-2025-21330/README.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21330.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/b5100979f8c44200a9b65976c3ddceb21c01ae6d/2025/CVE-2025-21330.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/c949b5afda95fd3ee92c221c6623ec029ede4a68/2025/CVE-2025-21330/poc.py","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-213xx/CVE-2025-21330.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"re