该漏洞需要物理访问权限才能利用，限制物理接触受影响的系统可作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21327","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27584df20575115093a915d82c76b5107dd9d51e/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21327.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0fed28f73afbb5eb38c05b167f63ae6a3a91eb60/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21327.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21327.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21327.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/29c2ed08a73c612e5ed2935720296628adaebf63/2025/CVE-2025-21327/README.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21327.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/29c2ed08a73c612e5ed2935720296628adaebf63/2025/CVE-2025-21327/poc.py","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21327.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/230692da2420d9855e520154fdb81ed9f2cb832a/2025/CVE-2025-21327.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21327"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0786.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0785","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0785.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21326","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Internet Explorer 的 MSHTML 引擎存在类型混淆（Type Confusion，CWE-843）漏洞，攻击者可通过构造特制的网页或文件诱导用户打开，触发内存损坏，从而在当前用户上下文中实现远程代码执行。成功利用该漏洞可获取目标系统的机密性、完整性和可用性控制权。该漏洞影响所有受支持的 Windows 系统中默认安装的 Internet Explorer 11 组件，攻击复杂度低且无需提前获取权限，但需要用户交互配合。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","scor